  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decontamination of Tiete River, Stage I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Descontaminacin del Ro Tiete, Etapa I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM OBJECTIVE IS TO IMPROVE ENVIRONMENTAL CONDITIONS IN THE UPPER BASIN OF THE TIETE RIVER, BY INSTALLING SEWERAGE SYSTEMS AND TREATMENT PLANTS TO REDUCE THE LEVEL OF DOMESTIC AND INDUSTRIAL POLLUTION IN THE TIETE RIVER AND THE METROPOLITAN REGION OF SAO PAULO.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
